OL,3,GFEATURES CThe introduction of colour on
OL,4,CBBC One and ITV
OL,5,
OL,6,FARCHIVE: YouTube: Kaleidoscope
OL,7,
OL,8,FThis weekend marks the 56th anniversary
OL,9,Fof the start of colour television on
OL,10,FBBC One and ITV.
OL,11,
OL,12,FBoth main channels were allowed to
OL,13,Fbroadcast in UHF on 625 lines in colour
OL,14,Ffrom 15th November 1969.
OL,15,
OL,16,FThis date was dictated by the
OL,17,Fgovernment not the choice of the
OL,18,Fbroadcasters themselvesB ` something
OL,19,Fthat may seem unimaginable now.
OL,20,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12102
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F121A1768699310
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}          G2/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CThe introduction of colour on
OL,4,CBBC One and ITV
OL,5,
OL,6,FBBC Two had been broadcasting in colour
OL,7,Ffor two years by then and was, of
OL,8,Fcourse, only on UHF and 625 lines from
OL,9,Fthe start.
OL,10,
OL,11,FA recent post on a TV chatroom asked an
OL,12,Finteresting question: When did your BBC
OL,13,FOne region go colour?
OL,14,
OL,15,FThe answer is not simple but it's a
OL,16,Fstory worth telling.B
OL,17,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
