OL,3,GFEATURES CThe introduction of colour on
OL,4,CBBC One and ITV
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is easy to say when each ITV company
OL,7,Fswitched to colour. These were big
OL,8,Fevents for the company locally and
OL,9,Foften accompanied by huge promotional
OL,10,Factivity.
OL,11,
OL,12,FThe big 5 ` Thames, LWT, ATV, Yorkshire
OL,13,Fand Granada ` all switched to colour in
OL,14,FNovember 1969.B
OL,15,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12104
SC,0004
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F121A1768699310
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}          G4/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CThe introduction of colour on
OL,4,CBBC One and ITV
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was not certain until a late stage
OL,7,Fthat the Emley Moore transmitter
OL,8,Fserving Yorkshire ` then a temporary
OL,9,Fstructure after the collapse of the
OL,10,Fmain mast a few months earlier ` would
OL,11,Fbe ready for the 15th.B
OL,12,
OL,13,FTV Times had a special colour cover in
OL,14,FLondon, the Midlands and the North West
OL,15,Fbut not Yorkshire.
OL,16,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
