OL,3,GFEATURES CThe introduction of colour on
OL,4,CBBC One and ITV
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe other ITV companies across Great
OL,7,FBritain and Northern Ireland gradually
OL,8,Fswitched to colour transmission over
OL,9,Fthe next two years with great local
OL,10,Ffanfare.
OL,11,
OL,12,FIt should be remembered that the order
OL,13,Fhad nothing to do with the local
OL,14,Fcompanies ` it was about the extension
OL,15,Fof the UHF transmitter network by the
OL,16,FBBC and ITA.
OL,17,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12106
SC,0006
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F121A1768699310
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}          G6/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CThe introduction of colour on
OL,4,CBBC One and ITV
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut, in general, the large and
OL,7,Fmedium-sized companies were also able
OL,8,Fto produce a large proportion of their
OL,9,Flocal output in colour at the point of
OL,10,Fswitchover.
OL,11,
OL,12,FSTV ` recovering from a fire which
OL,13,Fdevastated their main Glasgow studio `
OL,14,Fstill had a colour OB unit and a colour
OL,15,Fstudio in Edinburgh.
OL,16,
OL,17,FSouthern moved to a new studio complex
OL,18,Fwhich was ready for colour.
OL,19,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12107
SC,0007
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F121A1768699310
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}          G7/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CThe introduction of colour on
OL,4,CBBC One and ITV
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut some small companies like Border
OL,7,Fand Grampian had very limited colour
OL,8,Ffacilities to begin with.
OL,9,
OL,10,FMy understanding is that all Border's
OL,11,Fprogrammes remained in black and white.
OL,12,FBut it was able to show network
OL,13,Fprogrammes, programmes played out from
OL,14,Ffilm and adverts in colour from 1971.
OL,15,FBut it had no colour production or
OL,16,Fcolour VT facilities of its own to
OL,17,Fbegin with.
OL,18,
OL,19,FGrampian may have been in a similar
OL,20,Fsituation.
OL,21,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
