SC,0008
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F121A1768699310
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}          G8/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CThe introduction of colour on
OL,4,CBBC One and ITV
OL,5,
OL,6,FGenerally, the launch of ITV in colour
OL,7,Fwas a big event in each region.
OL,8,
OL,9,FITA trade test transmissions continued
OL,10,Fto use the monochrome test card D until
OL,11,Fthe local switch to UHF and colour.
OL,12,
OL,13,FTV Times' regional editions did not
OL,14,Froutinely mention whether a programme
OL,15,Fwas in colour until colour was actually
OL,16,Favailable in that region.
OL,17,
OL,18,FBut, to go back to the original
OL,19,Fquestion, it was a different story with
OL,20,FBBC One.
OL,21,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
