SC,0012
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F121A1768699310
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}         G12/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CThe introduction of colour on
OL,4,CBBC One and ITV
OL,5,
OL,6,FBBC Midlands, as far as I am aware,
OL,7,Fswitched its local output to colour in
OL,8,F1971 when Pebble Mill opened. BBC
OL,9,FScotland's main studio ` often used for
OL,10,Fprestige drama ` was ready for colour
OL,11,Fbut it took a few years before opt out
OL,12,Fmaterial was routinely in colour.
OL,13,
OL,14,FAcross the country, some local BBC
OL,15,Foutput was in monochrome until the mid
OL,16,F70s. A recent Kaleidoscope video showed
OL,17,Fa black and white Northern Ireland news
OL,18,Fsummary in 1975.
OL,19,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12113
SC,0013
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F121A1768699310
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}         G13/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CThe introduction of colour on
OL,4,CBBC One and ITV
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile it may sound strange now to talk
OL,7,Fabout black and white regional output
OL,8,Fin the 1970s, it should be remembered
OL,9,Fthat a colour TV was an expensive
OL,10,Finvestment for viewers.B
OL,11,
OL,12,FColour TV sales and rentals only
OL,13,Fstarted to take off around 1973.
OL,14,
OL,15,FBy then, viewers in all major
OL,16,Fpopulation centres and allB TV regions
OL,17,F(other than Channel) had access to
OL,18,Fthree channels in colour. Sets were
OL,19,Ffalling in cost and improving in
OL,20,Fsophistication.B
OL,21,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12114
SC,0014
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F121A1768699310
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}         G14/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CThe introduction of colour on
OL,4,CBBC One and ITV
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ridiculous negative stories about
OL,7,Fcolour TV ` from horrendous hues on
OL,8,Fbadly adjusted sets being seen as the
OL,9,Fnorm, to fire hazards ` were being
OL,10,Fdisproved every time someone saw a
OL,11,Fproperly adjusted set in a showroom or
OL,12,Fa friend's house.
OL,13,
OL,14,FColour TV's spread across the ITV
OL,15,Fnetwork was a process.
OL,16,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12115
SC,0015
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F121A1768699310
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}         G15/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CThe introduction of colour on
OL,4,CBBC One and ITV
OL,5,
OL,6,FUltimately on our beloved BBC One (I
OL,7,Fuse the term deliberately after the
OL,8,Fpast week at the corporation) the
OL,9,Flaunch of colour was a national event `
OL,10,Feven if some of the country couldn't
OL,11,Fjoin the party for some time.B
OL,12,
OL,13,FThe vast majority of BBC One evening
OL,14,Fprogrammes were broadcast in colour
OL,15,Ffrom 15th November 1969.
OL,16,
OL,17,FThere were a few exceptions ` Z Cars
OL,18,Fremained in black and white for a few
OL,19,Fmore weeks although other drama was in
OL,20,Fcolour.B
OL,21,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12116
SC,0016
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F121A1768699310
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}         G16/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CThe introduction of colour on
OL,4,CBBC One and ITV
OL,5,
OL,6,FWithin a few months, it was very
OL,7,Funusual for a new network programme `
OL,8,Fother than a schools or adult education
OL,9,Fprogramme `B to be in black and white.
OL,10,
OL,11,FThere were conspicuous exceptions.
OL,12,
OL,13,FBlue Peter did not go into colour until
OL,14,FSeptember 1970.
OL,15,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
