SC,0017
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F121A1768699310
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}         G17/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CThe introduction of colour on
OL,4,CBBC One and ITV
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere is some ambiguity concerning when
OL,7,Fthe studio presentation of the network
OL,8,Fportion of Nationwide went into colour.
OL,9,FThe programme was not billed as a
OL,10,Fcolour programme and a lot of the
OL,11,Freports and interviews from the regions
OL,12,Fwere in black and white for many years.
OL,13,
OL,14,FWhile no colour recordings of
OL,15,FNationwide in this era are believed to
OL,16,Fexist, the BBC archive holds some film
OL,17,Freports from Nationwide in 1969/70
OL,18,Fwhich were in colour.B
OL,19,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12118
SC,0018
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F121A1768699310
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}         G18/19
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CThe introduction of colour on
OL,4,CBBC One and ITV
OL,5,
OL,6,FGenerally when BBC One colour
OL,7,Ftransmissions spread to a new region,
OL,8,Fthe regional output initially stayed in
OL,9,Fmonochrome.
OL,10,
OL,11,FAnother Interesting point...
OL,12,
OL,13,FWhile there were restrictions on full
OL,14,Fcolour transmissions before 15th
OL,15,FNovember 1969, these did not applyB to
OL,16,Fthe spread of colour afterwards.
OL,17,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
